  "text": "I used to spend 30 minutes every single morning trying to figure out what my priorities were. And to be honest with you, it made me feel behind before the day had even started. But then I built an AI OS. Think of it like my own Jarvis from Iron Man, a personalized AI system that understands me and my work, remembers what's important, and helps me manage my tasks, my appointments, my decisions, and my workflows. And now, instead of digging through my task list, my calendar, and my messages, I can see what needs my attention, and I can just get straight to work. So if you've been feeling scattered, this is what you need. It's like having your own executive assistant helping you manage your life. And if you'd like help building yours, then click below to learn more.",
  "audio_duration_secs": 31.933333
}